{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrelia Adventures is a 3D platformer where two characters from different worlds are transported to the world of Surrelia. They must work together and find their way back home, by solving puzzles, speaking to the inhabitants and fighting off dangerous foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002830/extras/4b956108de908cc1ab49f14816166db1.avif?t=1758199499\" width=1501 height=761 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Characters Abilities</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two characters that you control means double possibility, with Geo(Red) being able to shrink down to enter secret areas, and Pokko(Purple) being able to jump on top of the highest hills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat differs with Geo being a melee only character, great for close combat, which differs from Pokko who shoots from a blaster, great for keeping your distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002830/extras/239729ad122ad44e405d39e09702cf08.avif?t=1758199499\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Level themes</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels around visually striking environments in different regions, each region is home to a different species based on the ecosystem, so be sure to speak to them and hear what they have to say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002830/extras/5b50b624fa9c6bd8562ea45b4b090883.avif?t=1758199499\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>World Experience</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrelia is a vibrant and joyful place, so be sure to see as much as you can through this adventure all while collecting special power ups and gems to get a high score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i><strong>Credits</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devonte Griffiths- Lead Developer, Main Programmer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max Oxman- Game Designer, 3D Modeller, Environment Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devin Brown- 3D Modeller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carlo Olivas- UI, Settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keiran Sayer- Level Design, Secondary Assets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a special thank you to Salim Hasshu- Mentor, Publisher \u2018DeMon Games\u2019, at De Montfort University</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Information</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocks and Combined Asset- fab- raffyraffy- Under public license- Textures altered- CC License 4.0- <u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002830?t=1758199499","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002830/be7ca990fb96d46052dc59a563740d8de938a8d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758199499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002830/dc0abe5b9ed6799cebc4836f21cff2eea244330e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758199499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002830/dc0abe5b9ed6799cebc4836f21cff2eea244330e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758199499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap